direction: right
User: User {shape: person}
API: Feed API {shape: rectangle}
Posts: Post service {shape: rectangle}
Graph: Social graph service {shape: rectangle}
PostDB: Post database {shape: cylinder}
Events: Post events {shape: queue}
Fanout: Fan-out workers {shape: rectangle}
FeedCache: Feed cache {shape: stored_data}
Celebrities: On-read ranking {shape: rectangle}
User -> API: read feed
User -> Posts: publish
Posts -> PostDB
Posts -> Events
Events -> Fanout
Fanout -> Graph: followers
Fanout -> FeedCache
API -> FeedCache
API -> Celebrities
Celebrities -> PostDB
